      <h1>Aliyah Snead</h1>
      <p>This portfolio highlights my work as an Information Systems student, including academic projects, skills I’ve developed, and the values that guide my career in tech.</p>
      <p>I believe technology should protect and empower people. As an aspiring Security Analyst, I’m passionate about building secure, accessible systems—especially for vulnerable communities like the elderly. I lead with curiosity, communicate clearly, and aim to create solutions that make both systems and lives better.</p>
